 realt\u00e0 virtuale, un'avvincente narrativa che tratta il tema del caporalato. Avrai a disposizione un mazzo di carte per sconfiggere la mafia, ogni carta porter\u00e0 conseguenza positive o negative in tutta la citt\u00e0. Fai la tua scelta e gioca la tua carta!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Carta_Nostra_Logo_1440_Transparent.png", "id": "7043425425741004", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974482_7043425432407670_5671989590901130667_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dwa2c53o7Z4Q7kNvwF73yve&_nc_oc=Adr0zyRL2PAIw55bX5Mrrx0Ho6DNo7TU0donsw-fVEz9bbz1fFh0jz-fn9ASyZwa4fU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSsgDHJmvLhIi_WO_DjxlUO-j9L5CtR_6tAdYdZiRxWXQ&oe=6B008290"}, {"file_name": "CartaNostra_Logo02.png", "id": "2827330754076823", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_2827330757410156_6515219377821251284_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vgPG_qK2fBkQ7kNvwFxe-XF&_nc_oc=Ado1o3SwiICFqqzd0MbQVe7ViBaELS3kwa3szgYCzSqQcWRNz4W7fqhtkQeamZ46AII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR1LmE59v7jT_b9ERaOhnOeXeXA-N98xpXxkF5eOYj0hQ&oe=6B005944"}, {"file_name": "Carta_Nostra_Square_1440-1440.png", "id": "1149684542675806", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974692_1149684546009139_7602248288164393664_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iZ9zG6ZxIiEQ7kNvwGizq9n&_nc_oc=AdoEG2KbNcunu3FD5t4Qkoo88wLtuN85P93LlDgzHx8ZfLN2aPHheYJMpnfGq2W7GXM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQShrEX3319JPvjXMSTe0HVoDrJ2hii-TM5rDWhoS-Y3UA&oe=6B0073F0"}, {"file_name": "PDPART02.png", "id": "1140322596965596", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/390315